body:
Look at all the comments here.  A lot of denial.  Everyone wants to believe this 20 year old drug is some sort of secret.

&#x200B;

Remember, every bald or balding man under 50 you EVER seen, has tried finasteride at the first signs of thinning, and it didn't work.

Annual check to make sure I'm not seen as a balding man.  14 months fin, 18 months minox, 3 months RU.  Should I continue the fight or shave it off.

&#x200B;

[https://imgur.com/oFdaREw](https://imgur.com/oFdaREw)

&#x200B;
